  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Bonus Action, you can discern the strengths and weaknesses of a creature you can see within 30 feet of you: you learn whether it has any Immunities, Resistances, or Vulnerabilities, and what they are. Once you use this feature, you can't do so again until you finish a Long Rest, but you can restore it by expending one Superiority Die (no action required).</p>",
